---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactForm.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Tell us what your team does by hand that it shouldn't. If we can't help you, you don't pay."
>
  <section class="nf-section">
    <div class="nf-content">
      <h1>Start here</h1>
      <p>
        Tell us what your team does by hand that it shouldn't. The messy one is usually
        the right one — the process everyone already knows should be automated and
        nobody has had time to take apart.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nf-section">
    <div class="nf-content">
      <h2>Terms</h2>
      <p>
        Discovery is a $1,000 working session, non-refundable, credited against your
        invoice if you engage. It ends with a written findings memo: what we'd automate
        first, where your process splits into stages, what we'd verify, roughly what it
        costs. It exists to filter people shopping for a silver bullet.
      </p>
      <p>If we can't help you, you don't pay.</p>
      <p>
        Done-for-you: we build it, we hand it over, and your team is walked into the
        system by a person rather than a login and a document.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nf-section">
    <div class="nf-content">
      <h2>Who reads this</h2>
      <p>
        Every message sent to no.fail is read by a person, and the reply comes from a
        person. Nothing here is automated.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nf-section">
    <div class="nf-content">
      <ContactForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
